        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System generates milestone invoice upon milestone completion sign-off; Project Consultant collects payment; Finance tracks project payment status: deposit, progress payments, final payment
Responsible (R): System / Project Consultant / Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 30 min per milestone</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2443_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2443_End5" name="Complete">
