      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project completed; warranty documentation
Frequency: ~300–450 project completions/month
Volume: ~300–450/month
Owner: Project Consultant
Participants: Project Consultant, Customer, CRM
Source: workflow W2444 — Project Warranty Handover</bpmn:documentation>
