        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System registers all product warranties in CRM per VS-53; project record linked to customer profile for future reference and follow-up; customer satisfaction survey sent
Responsible (R): System / Project Consultant
Accountable (A): CRM Manager
Duration: Automated + 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2444_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
